Cline stores its provider in VS Code extension state, so yb does not edit it.
In Cline, choose an OpenAI-compatible provider.
Base URL: https://gw.example/v1
Model: gpt
Do not paste the API key. Put the output of `yb key print` into Cline's key field, or export YABANIN_API_KEY.
Custom header: X-Yabanin-Labels: team=payments
